#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:1
#: a486978c7b9948a3831b180fb0971a99
msgid "按索引精确选中一批结构"
msgstr "Select Structures Precisely by Index"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:3
#: 5275bcd76e8c40d1b7bf9bab67b6c508
msgid ""
"已经从日志、训练结果或外部脚本拿到结构编号时，不必在散点图里逐个点选。"
"`Select by Index` 可以一次选中离散编号和连续切片，适合复核、导出或删除一批已"
"知结构。"
msgstr ""
"When structure indices already come from a log, training result, or external "
"script, you do not need to click points one by one. `Select by Index` "
"accepts both individual indices and slices, making it useful for reviewing, "
"exporting, or removing a known set of structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:5
#: 76c25adc27254eb8a3a7e354634f2ffd
