#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:21
#: c73827eed074472bbdc757e022dfccbb
msgid ""
"这里的编号从 `0` 开始，切片右端不包含在内，因此实际选中 `0、5、10、11、12`，"
"共 5 个结构。逗号用于分隔多段输入，`10:13` 的写法与 Python 切片一致。"
msgstr ""
"Indices start at `0`, and the right endpoint of a slice is excluded. This "
"expression therefore selects `0, 5, 10, 11, 12`, for a total of five "
"structures. Commas separate entries, and `10:13` follows Python slice syntax."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:23
#: 019453af028140389fb477e17444979e
msgid ""
"一般保持 `Use original indices` 勾选。这样即使之前筛选或删除过结构，编号仍对"
"应最初载入文件时的顺序；取消勾选后，编号指当前活动结构列表中的位置。"
msgstr ""
"Usually keep `Use original indices` enabled. The indices then refer to the "
"order in the originally loaded file even after filtering or deletion. When "
"disabled, they refer to positions in the current active-structure list."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:25
